  "stageId": "main_03-03",
  "title": "Convolution",
  "storyCode": "3-3",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ef215c1413130d6d2d2fdfdb89796f89081f2a4b7fd94e116d709247b34e3e40",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十五关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Look.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Hmm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "This is the trigger.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Just load the ammo like this...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Aim at the enemy, and pull the trigger.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "This will launch the bullet...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Then concentrate, and grip the handle.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Concentrate... and channel your Arts.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "This will cause the bullet to detonate.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I don't know if I can...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "I know you can do this.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "We have a lot in common. I can feel it within you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Just picture it in your mind...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Here, hold on to this Originium shard.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Nnh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Concentrate.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "My palm feels... hot.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "That's right!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "I knew it, I knew it...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Yes, Misha, you really are... Haha, ahaha...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "You really are my...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "...We have to go! Skullshatterer, hurry!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "We can't hold this base anymore!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "What happened?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Rhodes Island is attacking! We're being rushed!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Those bastards...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Don't panic. Regroup and prepare our counterattack!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Skullshatterer...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I'm sure... Rhodes Island will...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Will what? You want me to have a chat with Rhodes Island?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "They, they're surely trying to help the Infected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "They killed so many of my comrades...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "You're really asking me to talk to them?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "All my comrades... they were Infected too!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Rhodes Island, those self-proclaimed saviors of the Infected... what did they do to help my comrades?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "What did they say to you to blind you?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I don't know...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Sorry...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "I'm getting too emotional.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "But one thing is certain...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Reunion has finally provided a sliver of hope to the Infected after all this time...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "But Rhodes Island, despite being Infected, chose to hurt us, to slaughter us!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "What are they but traitors?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "What is there to discuss with traitors?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Are the Infected doomed to always kill each other then?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Then, what am I supposed to do...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Should I just stand by and watch my comrades die?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Don't worry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "We'll protect you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "You'll also have to protect yourself though...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Don't get pulled into the fighting.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Please be careful...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Promise... you'll come back...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Just when I finally found you again...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Yeah. I'll come back for you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Then, we'll go home together...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...Mhm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Hey there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "So, you need my help after all?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "That's right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Actually... the situation is a bit different from what Talulah told us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "The enemy is more powerful than we expected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "That's why... you have to protect Misha.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "I don't think I'm obligated to do that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "You are.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Fine, fine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "However, it's not enough to just protect Misha, is it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "If you fail, they'll still catch up to us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "What do you have in mind?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Skullshatterer, don't you remember what I told you before?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "...I do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "We can turn the tables if we take out that target.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Dr. {@nickname}...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "See, you were paying attention. All we have to do is take out their commander. Easy, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "The hooded person who's always next to that bunny girl.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "The person who leads Rhodes Island's combat operations.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "If you can kill that one... Bang!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Just like that, their brain will be gone.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Everything will be so easy after that~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "We don't have many troops left, and we're running out of options.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "There's a location near the front of the mines that will be great for setting up our ambush.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "My casters will provide cover for you... You know what to do, don't you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "I'll use my troops to draw them here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Don't miss this opportunity~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "I understand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "...Take care of Misha for me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Sure thing~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Hmph... Anyways, good luck.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
